llvm-dsdl (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * State what the runtime permits a caller to overlap
  * Bumping the working version to 0.3.0
  * Adding anaphor rules to AGENTS.md
  * Split aliasability into wire-flat and host-image, and build what each...
  * Stop qualifying declared parameters const (#32)
  * Build an initialise body and spell it in every language (#31)
  * Name a union's options and a definition's port-ID (#30)
  * Fold fixed layouts in the plan bodies, and measure the serdes against...
  * Name a plan body's values from the operations that define them (#27)
  * Validate array lengths in the plan bodies and guard every backend (#26)
  * Make every backend a translation of the plan bodies (#25)
  * Remove the deprecation pragmas from generated C, C++ and Rust (#24)
  * Docs/cli options from help (#23)
  * Lower DSDL directly to object code (#22)
  * Take the generated source out of string literals (#21)
  * Feature/cleanup pass (#20)
  * Feature/stropping and versioning (#19)

